==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|хуй|t1=dick|-ня}}; compare {{m|ru|фигня́}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|хуйня́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-хуйня.ogg}}

===Noun===
[[File:Кыргызстан, Бишкек, Карагачёвая роща, бордюр (нецензурный).jpg|thumb|180px|"хуйня" written on the curb with an arrow sign showing that there's some bullshit there]]
{{ru-noun+|хуйня́}}

# {{lb|ru|obscene}} [[shit]], [[crap]] {{gloss|A problem or difficult situation}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[вот]] [[ведь]] '''хуйня́'''|that is bullshit}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[такой|таку́ю]] '''хуйню́''' [[он]] [[не]] [[допустить|допу́стит]]|he will not allow such crap}}
# {{lb|ru|obscene}} [[shit]] {{gloss|nonsense, bullshit}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar}} [[shit]] {{gloss|rubbish; worthless matter}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar}} [[shit]] {{gloss|stuff, things}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar}} [[nothing]] {{gloss|not a real problem}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[этот|э́то]] [[ещё]] '''хуйня́'''|that is still not a fucking big deal}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[он]] [[этот|э́то]] [[затеять|зате́ял]] [[и́з-за]] [[тако́й]] '''хуйни́'''|he started it over fucking nothing}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar}} [[whatchamacallit]] {{gloss|unrecognized object}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[а]] [[этот|э́то]] [[что]] [[за]] '''хуйня́'''?|what the fuck is this?}}

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|хуйня́}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|ru|херня́}}
* {{l|ru|хрень}}
* {{l|ru|поебе́нь}}
* {{l|ru|фигня́}} {{q|less crude}}

